        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Arc[ebiscop]es 7 æþelinges wergild is XV þusend þrymsa.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The wergild of the archbishop and the atheling is 15,000 thrymsas.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Æþelinges wergyld is XV þusend þrymsa.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">A nobleman's wergild is fifteen thousand thrymsas.</ab>
